---
/**
 * The "Processed locally — nothing uploaded" affordance.
 *
 * Every tool surface carries one (CLAUDE.md contract 3: privacy is the
 * product). It was copy-pasted byte-for-byte into all 8 island status bars,
 * shield path included — so the promise the user reads was 8 strings that
 * could drift apart. It is one string now.
 *
 * Renders as the trailing item of a status bar: `ml-auto` pushes it right.
 * Zero JS, no props — the wording is deliberately not configurable, because
 * the claim it makes is a contract, not copy.
 */
---

<span class="ml-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-caption text-mute">
	<svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
		<path
			d="M8 1.5 3 3.5v3.2c0 3 2.1 5.8 5 6.8 2.9-1 5-3.8 5-6.8V3.5L8 1.5Z"
			stroke="currentColor"
			stroke-width="1.3"
			stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
	</svg>
	Processed locally — nothing uploaded
</span>
